  m_Name: Carta_PostoDeSaude
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Posto de Sa\xFAde"
  _titleEn: Health Clinic
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "A aten\xE7\xE3o b\xE1sica resolve a maior parte dos problemas de sa\xFAde
    perto de casa e evita que eles cheguem ao hospital."
  _summaryEn: Primary care solves most health problems close to home and keeps them
    from reaching the hospital.
  _realWorld: "A Estrat\xE9gia Sa\xFAde da Fam\xEDlia, iniciada em 1994, leva equipes
    com m\xE9dico, enfermagem e agentes comunit\xE1rios \xE0s Unidades B\xE1sicas
    de Sa\xFAde de todo o pa\xEDs."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's Family Health Strategy, started in 1994, sends teams with
    a doctor, nurses and community health agents to basic health units across the
    country.
  _tradeOffs: "Falta de m\xE9dicos em regi\xF5es afastadas e o custo de manter as
    equipes s\xE3o os maiores desafios."
  _tradeOffsEn: Doctor shortages in remote areas and the cost of keeping the teams
    running are the biggest challenges.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Estrat\xE9gia Sa\xFAde da Fam\xEDlia (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Estrat%C3%A9gia_Sa%C3%BAde_da_Fam%C3%ADlia
